# Design notes — FloqAi help partitions

Partitions (internal keys): `patronHelpverbiage`, `serviceMemberHelpverbiage`, `venueAdminHelpverbiage`, `masterAdminHelpverbiage`.

| Partition | Access |
|---|---|
| patron | `IsPatron=1` **or** `IsMasterAdmin=1` |
| serviceMember | `IsServiceMember=1` (after elect + venue approval) **or** `IsMasterAdmin=1` |
| venueAdmin | `IsVenueAdmin=1` / club admin **or** `IsMasterAdmin=1` |
| masterAdmin | `IsMasterAdmin=1` only |

Contextual search returns blank when the signed-in entity lacks the matching flag. Client filtering is UX only — never put secrets in help bodies.

## Help vs this file

Served FloqAi audience help may say roles see matching help. Do **not** list partition key names or the flag matrix in `?` / FloqAi bodies.
